===Alternative forms===
* [[pickax]]
* [[pick-axe]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|picois|lang=fro}}, later alteration due to folk etymology association with [[pick]] and [[axe]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈpɪkˌæks/}}
* {{audio|En-us-pickaxe.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[heavy]] [[iron]] [[tool]] with a [[wooden]] [[handle]]; one end of the [[head]] is [[pointed]], the other has a [[chisel]] [[edge]].

